          <h2>Hi, I'm a Frontend Web Developer...</h2>
          <p>... in Berlin, but originally from the Rhineland area! I am Ingo Steinke, freelance web developer focused on the front-end with more than 25 years of professional experience, most of it in Cologne, Düsseldorf and Münster. I currently live and <a href="freelance-webdeveloper-berlin.html">work in Berlin</a>.</p>

          <p>Thanks in part to family ties in North Rhine-Westphalia, in the Bergisches Land and the southern Rhineland region, I maintain a local presence in the area. Consequently, collaborating with agencies and clients in Cologne, Düsseldorf, Hilden, Haan, Solingen, Erkrath, or Wuppertal can also include regular in-person meetings on-site.
          </p>

          <p>As a web developer, I worked for the Cologne-based companies nexum and Railslove gearbeitet, after working as a technical consultant at Sevenval (later Avenga) in Köln, Berlin and remote. From 2019 to 2021, I co-hosted the Cologne Web Performance meetup.</p>

          <p>I implemented the following projects with teams in Cologne for German and international clients.</p>

