            <a href="{{ content.targetHrConciseCvUrl }}" hreflang="de" target="_blank">CV with skills and projects as a PDF</a> and find details about my <a href="/leistungen/">skills and services</a>, <a href="/projekte/">references and projects</a>.</p>

          <p>Apart from technology, I have a lot of experience and initiative, but thanks to my communication skills, I am also a team player. If you share a spontaneous idea with me, in a meeting, at the coffee machine, or over the phone, I will take a note, prioritize, and implement it in a well-tested and documented way. As I said, that can happen on premise or completely remote. Modern technology makes it possible. But I’m also happy to meet in person, if that works best for you.</p>

          <h2>No-Obligation Introductory Meeting</h2>

          <p>My initial consultation is generally non-binding and free of charge, for individual clients as well as for companies and intermediaries.</p>

          <p>Let's talk about your next project! Leave me as message, and I will contact you.</p>

